    "detailed_description": "<strong>Menyr</strong> is a groundbreaking <strong>storytelling engine</strong> that allows you to create immersive worlds in seconds and play with your friends in a virtual tabletop setting. <br>With stunning AAA graphics, Menyr lets you generate entire worlds, from procedural dungeons to dynamic biomes, all while providing a comprehensive set of tools for playing your favorite TTRPGs. Experience the ultimate customization with Menyr's community-driven platform, where you can create, share, and modify worlds, characters, and events. <br>Get ready to bring your stories to life and embark on epic adventures in a seamless and immersive gaming experience.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Menyr</strong> is a groundbreaking <strong>storytelling engine</strong> that allows you to create immersive worlds in seconds and play with your friends in a virtual tabletop setting. <br>With stunning AAA graphics, Menyr lets you generate entire worlds, from procedural dungeons to dynamic biomes, all while providing a comprehensive set of tools for playing your favorite TTRPGs. Experience the ultimate customization with Menyr's community-driven platform, where you can create, share, and modify worlds, characters, and events. <br>Get ready to bring your stories to life and embark on epic adventures in a seamless and immersive gaming experience.",
    "short_description": "Create immersive worlds in seconds and play with friends in Menyr's storytelling engine. Generate dungeons, change biomes, and enjoy AAA graphics. Fully customizable, community-driven, and free, Menyr brings your TTRPG adventures to life in a seamless and immersive virtual tabletop experience.",
